  | ⟨19, _⟩ => kit19
  | ⟨20, _⟩ => kit20
  | ⟨21, _⟩ => kit21
  | ⟨22, _⟩ => kit22
  | ⟨23, _⟩ => kit23
  | ⟨24, _⟩ => kit24
  | ⟨25, _⟩ => kit25
  | ⟨26, _⟩ => kit26
  | ⟨27, _⟩ => kit27
  | ⟨28, _⟩ => kit28
  | ⟨29, _⟩ => kit29
  | ⟨30, _⟩ => kit30
